# Normalise all text files to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this, editing on Windows can silently rewrite a whole file to CRLF,
# turning a small change into a whole-file diff that destroys `git blame`.
# `eol=lf` also keeps the shell scripts under scripts/ executable — CRLF line
# endings break their shebang.
* text=auto eol=lf
